<title>FRANCE: EU rejects wheat bids, closes campaign - trade.</title>
<headline>EU rejects wheat bids, closes campaign - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday rejected bids for soft wheat exports and declared the 1996/97 campaign for free market soft wheat over, grain traders said.</p>
<p>They said the EU's management committee in Brussels had closed the export tender for 1996/97 soft wheat.</p>
</text>
